  "events": [
    {
      "text": "Golden fans, blue glass. Inspired by the fan-shaped ginkgo leaves in Smithsonian Gardens: https://gardens.si.edu/collections/explore/object/ofeo-sg_2013-0618A . I will practice curved leaf silhouettes, varied edges, and selective light accents in an original still life.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8320,
      "afterStroke": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "The wash has a soft S-shaped edge and an empty left shoulder. I will join the body into one bottle mass, then place the stem above the narrow neck.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7540,
      "afterStroke": 3
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 7
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "The connected bottle mass reads clearly; the neck still has a pale hole and the base floats. First I will balance it with two golden fans, using curved sweeps rather than polygon outlines.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8580,
      "afterStroke": 7
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 11
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "The leaf sweeps made rounded crescents with empty centers. I will fill each fan toward its stem junction, preserving the curved outer edge.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6000,
      "afterStroke": 11
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Filling closed the two large crescents, but the smaller upper leaf is still hollow. The bottle needs a grounded base and darker right side to give these pale leaves a firm anchor.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8320,
      "afterStroke": 14
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "The darker base and trailing shadow now anchor the bottle. I will test one narrow pale acrylic reflection on its lit left side before adding more highlights.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 7020,
      "afterStroke": 17
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 18
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
